sequenceDiagram
  participant Inspector
  participant Steam as Workshop metadata and downloader
  participant Rules as Level inspector
  participant DB as Database
  participant Store as Object storage
  participant Discord
  Inspector->>Steam: Load submissions and download items
  Steam-->>Inspector: Archive files
  Inspector->>Rules: Parse levels and apply contest rules
  Rules-->>Inspector: Valid, invalid, and diagnostic results
  Inspector->>DB: Save validation and playlist state
  Inspector->>Store: Save generated archive and playlist
  Inspector->>Discord: Deliver validation and playlist notifications
  Inspector->>DB: Record delivery for restart-safe recovery
